{"hash": "8031287f221e59ee", "keywords": null, "kind": "note", "note": "★ 誠實報：預註冊之 P8 唯一性**被本輪否證** —— 「乘積層 + 非 tie 一致」不足以唯一固定 tie 位（(⟨u,r⟩,+u×r) 與 (⟨u,r⟩,−u×r) 皆 R≡0 但 1200 條 tie 值全相異）。修正後之真結論：tie 位分解為「障礙位（宇稱，affects R）」＋「R-中性位（向量部符號）」", "num": null, "owner": null, "pid": "O225/R4", "prev_hash": "895ad1b25bb83aec", "ref": "docs/08_r4_results.md", "session": "20261001_114343_a5b687", "slug": null, "source": "cli", "state": null, "state_source": null, "target_pid": null, "title": null, "ts": "2026-10-01T11:53:39+08:00", "verdict": null}
