{"hash": "dce5d28c1ae8a4a3", "keywords": null, "kind": "note", "note": "Q1 [全軸普查]：62 軸（31 對）逐條作參考軸算 n_tie 與 tie 集型別；預註冊 n_tie ∈ {0,5} 且 n_tie=5 時 tie 集全 edge 型", "num": null, "owner": null, "pid": "O225/R5", "prev_hash": "755fc528635f73ed", "ref": "/home/wsl/Projects/IDCM-Original/IDCM-v10.0--It-From-Beat/open_problems_fresh/o225_mechanism_born_forcing/docs/09_r5_contract.md", "session": "20261001_114343_a5b687", "slug": null, "source": "cli", "state": null, "state_source": null, "target_pid": null, "title": null, "ts": "2026-10-01T11:58:56+08:00", "verdict": null}
{"hash": "09b85efb59860f77", "keywords": null, "kind": "note", "note": "Q2 [軌道-穩定子]：H_r（線穩定子，階 20）作用於 31 軸對；預註冊 tie 集 = 單一軌道大小 5 ⟹ 「5」由群結構強制（|orbit| = |H|/|Stab|），非巧合", "num": null, "owner": null, "pid": "O225/R5", "prev_hash": "dce5d28c1ae8a4a3", "ref": "/home/wsl/Projects/IDCM-Original/IDCM-v10.0--It-From-Beat/open_problems_fresh/o225_mechanism_born_forcing/docs/09_r5_contract.md", "session": "20261001_114343_a5b687", "slug": null, "source": "cli", "state": null, "state_source": null, "target_pid": null, "title": null, "ts": "2026-10-01T11:58:56+08:00", "verdict": null}
{"hash": "350b5a5e8424b851", "keywords": null, "kind": "note", "note": "Q3 [全域計數]：6 條頂點軸之 tie 聯集 Σ n_tie = 30 = edge 軸數，且每 edge 軸恰被一條頂點軸 tie 一次（重數 ≡ 1）⟹ 30 = 6×5 係無重數雙射型計數", "num": null, "owner": null, "pid": "O225/R5", "prev_hash": "09b85efb59860f77", "ref": "/home/wsl/Projects/IDCM-Original/IDCM-v10.0--It-From-Beat/open_problems_fresh/o225_mechanism_born_forcing/docs/09_r5_contract.md", "session": "20261001_114343_a5b687", "slug": null, "source": "cli", "state": null, "state_source": null, "target_pid": null, "title": null, "ts": "2026-10-01T11:58:57+08:00", "verdict": null}
{"hash": "737e21fc758ff814", "keywords": null, "kind": "note", "note": "Q4 [幾何刻畫]：頂點軸參考之 5 條 tie 軸構成赤道平面正五邊形 —— 兩兩 |歸一化點積| 精確 ∈ {(1+√5)/4, (√5−1)/4}（判據：⟨u_i,u_j⟩² == N_i N_j (3±√5)/8）；預註冊 36°/72° 各 5 對", "num": null, "owner": null, "pid": "O225/R5", "prev_hash": "350b5a5e8424b851", "ref": "/home/wsl/Projects/IDCM-Original/IDCM-v10.0--It-From-Beat/open_problems_fresh/o225_mechanism_born_forcing/docs/09_r5_contract.md", "session": "20261001_114343_a5b687", "slug": null, "source": "cli", "state": null, "state_source": null, "target_pid": null, "title": null, "ts": "2026-10-01T11:58:57+08:00", "verdict": null}
{"hash": "8e6fe6787eb14dfb", "keywords": null, "kind": "note", "note": "Q5 [K-無關量]：K 與 K_Mb 各跑 120 態凍結協定；預註冊 hits、Σmisses、ledger_len 分佈、top 序列完全相同（控制流只依 ctx 序列）；overrides 與 overrides_first 一般相異。任一被否證 ⟹ 撤回該項", "num": null, "owner": null, "pid": "O225/R5", "prev_hash": "737e21fc758ff814", "ref": "/home/wsl/Projects/IDCM-Original/IDCM-v10.0--It-From-Beat/open_problems_fresh/o225_mechanism_born_forcing/docs/09_r5_contract.md", "session": "20261001_114343_a5b687", "slug": null, "source": "cli", "state": null, "state_source": null, "target_pid": null, "title": null, "ts": "2026-10-01T11:58:57+08:00", "verdict": null}
{"hash": "eef490c071281eec", "keywords": null, "kind": "note", "note": "Q6 [效應量化]：報告 overrides 兩表（相異值數/值域/差之分佈）+ 中心不變性；預註冊兩者皆中心不變（K_Mb[−s][a] = K_Mb[s][a] ⟹ λ ≡ +1，R3 定理適用）", "num": null, "owner": null, "pid": "O225/R5", "prev_hash": "8e6fe6787eb14dfb", "ref": "/home/wsl/Projects/IDCM-Original/IDCM-v10.0--It-From-Beat/open_problems_fresh/o225_mechanism_born_forcing/docs/09_r5_contract.md", "session": "20261001_114343_a5b687", "slug": null, "source": "cli", "state": null, "state_source": null, "target_pid": null, "title": null, "ts": "2026-10-01T11:58:57+08:00", "verdict": null}
