{"hash": "2ff9a702af7a7532", "keywords": null, "kind": "note", "note": "Q8 [可辨識性]：overrides 兩表相同 ⟹ 動態側不可辨識（負面結果）；相異 ⟹ 動態可辨識 + 差異樣本。兩者皆合法，不偏袒", "num": null, "owner": null, "pid": "O225/R5", "prev_hash": "be73ae90db2a5a26", "ref": "/home/wsl/Projects/IDCM-Original/IDCM-v10.0--It-From-Beat/open_problems_fresh/o225_mechanism_born_forcing/docs/09_r5_contract.md", "session": "20261001_114343_a5b687", "slug": null, "source": "cli", "state": null, "state_source": null, "target_pid": null, "title": null, "ts": "2026-10-01T11:58:58+08:00", "verdict": null}
