{"hash": "457bb5d971896a07", "keywords": null, "kind": "note", "note": "★ 見數後修正 C3a（非預測）：對 vertex 參考，15 條 edge 線**三分**為三族各 5：①環邊（ring 內相鄰對之中點）②環對角（ring 內相鄰對之另一取向類）③跨環（赤道帶）——實測 tie 集 = 第 ③ 族（赤道帶邊中點線，即十邊形之 5 條線；與 R5 Q4 之 36°/72° 一致）。Ω 判據：三族互斥且並 = 全部 15 條 edge 線。", "num": null, "owner": null, "pid": "O225/R6", "prev_hash": "46a76e93238f361f", "ref": "/home/wsl/Projects/IDCM-Original/IDCM-v10.0--It-From-Beat/open_problems_fresh/o225_mechanism_born_forcing/docs/11_r6_contract.md", "session": "20261001_120633_8672ce", "slug": null, "source": "cli", "state": null, "state_source": null, "target_pid": null, "title": null, "ts": "2026-10-01T12:23:56+08:00", "verdict": null}
