{"hash": "55472eb81659147d", "keywords": null, "kind": "registered", "note": "B5a【已知】（見數前）：K[s]==K[−s] 120/120 ∧ 行為類恰 60 ∧ 類大小全 2 ∧ 每類={s,−s} ∧ 商群階譜==A5 {1:1,2:15,3:20,5:24}；全中方 ✅（機制由觀察升格為導出）。", "num": null, "owner": "O227", "pid": "O227/R1-B5a", "prev_hash": "e229175c92d76899", "ref": "open_problems_fresh/o227_mapping_channel_no_signalling/docs/01_r1_contract.md", "session": "20261002_024204_328b2be2", "slug": "O227/R1-B5a", "source": "cli", "state": "registered", "state_source": "manual", "target_pid": null, "title": "B5a 2:1 機制", "ts": "2026-10-02T02:52:08+08:00", "verdict": null}
